Purpose: record already-completed safe transient-scope probe; no rerun. Scope proved `MemoryMax`/`MemorySwapMax` applied to child process in user sibling scope; no stress/OOM test.

Exact command:
```sh
systemd-run --user --scope --quiet -p MemoryMax=256M -p MemorySwapMax=0 /usr/bin/env sh -c 'printf "pid=%s\n" $$; cat /proc/self/cgroup; p=$(awk -F: '\''$1==0 {print $3}'\'' /proc/self/cgroup); cat /sys/fs/cgroup${p}/memory.max; cat /sys/fs/cgroup${p}/memory.swap.max'
```

Observed stdout:
